  },
  "decisions": [
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D1",
      "source_line": 28,
      "source_text": "D1 | 首版交付层级 | 单体 MVP 为主；下个版本再集成既有中台的调度与数据源；本次必须留好 adapter | 首版自闭环可运行；所有与外部中台服务的交互必须走 adapter 接口，不得硬编码依赖",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d1-delivery-level-and-adapter",
          "statement": "首版以单体 MVP 自闭环交付，下个版本再集成既有中台的调度与数据源；与外部中台服务的所有交互必须走 adapter 接口，不得硬编码依赖。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D2",
      "source_line": 29,
      "source_text": "D2 | 首版数据源登记 | 自建最简数据源 + adapter 接口 | 本地表保存最简连接信息与凭据；adapter 预留 YDS（既有数据源服务）实现，下版切换",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d2-self-built-minimal-datasource",
          "statement": "首版自建最简数据源登记与 adapter 接口；本地保存最简连接信息与凭据，adapter 预留 YDS 实现供下版切换。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D3",
      "source_line": 30,
      "source_text": "D3 | SeaTunnel 版本 | 直接上 3.0.0 | 接受\"刚 GA 数日 + 约 25 个连接器配置校验破坏性变更\"的风险；必须锁定补丁版本与制品哈希",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d3-seatunnel-3-0-0",
          "statement": "直接采用 SeaTunnel 3.0.0，接受\"刚 GA 数日与约 25 个连接器配置校验破坏性变更\"的风险，并锁定补丁版本与制品哈希。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D4",
      "source_line": 31,
      "source_text": "D4 | plugin-ingest 处置 | 能力迁到新单体模块；调度仓侧标弃用并保留兼容端点 | 新模块自持领域模型；旧 /ext/integration/** 冻结、标弃用、下版移除",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d4-plugin-ingest-capability-migration",
          "statement": "`plugin-ingest` 能力迁入新模块，调度仓侧旧端点冻结并标弃用、保留兼容端点，下版移除；新模块自持领域模型。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D5",
      "source_line": 32,
      "source_text": "D5 | 数据源单一化路径 | 第 1 轮答\"沿用 DatasourceSlotService 的 YDS 槽位\"，第 2 轮收敛为 首版本地 + adapter | 以第 2 轮为准（见第 3 节冲突裁决）；DatasourceSlotService 的 YDS 槽位成为 adapter 的目标实现",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d5-datasource-slot-yys-as-adapter-target",
          "statement": "数据源单一化以第 2 轮收敛结论为准：首版本地实现 + adapter；`DatasourceSlotService` 的 YDS 槽位成为 adapter 的目标实现。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D6",
      "source_line": 33,
      "source_text": "D6 | 自动建表 | 保留，且首次执行前人工确认一次 | 生成 DDL → 展示给用户确认 → 执行；与建模侧 DDL 治理的人工确认口径一致",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d6-auto-create-table-human-confirmation",
          "statement": "自动建表保留，且首次执行前人工确认一次：生成 DDL → 展示确认 → 执行；与建模侧 DDL 治理的人工确认口径一致。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D7",
      "source_line": 34,
      "source_text": "D7 | 权限模型 | 独立设计（原问题非是非题，按\"需要独立设计集成模块权限模型\"理解） | 不得复用调度侧恒真的 checkGroupPermission 作为权限依据",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d7-independent-permission-model",
          "statement": "集成模块权限模型独立设计，不得复用调度侧恒真的 `checkGroupPermission` 作为权限依据。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D8",
      "source_line": 35,
      "source_text": "D8 | 首版权限层级 | 登录 + 管理员/开发两角色 | 凭据仅管理员可见/可编辑；开发者不可获得凭据明文",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d8-login-two-roles",
          "statement": "首版权限层级为登录 + 管理员/开发两角色；凭据仅管理员可见/可编辑，开发者不可获得凭据明文。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D9",
      "source_line": 36,
      "source_text": "D9 | 一致性承诺 | at-least-once | 不做 XA/exactly-once；必须显式写出去重口径（主键 replace / 幂等键），并在验收中覆盖\"重复数据\"场景",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d9-at-least-once",
          "statement": "一致性承诺为 at-least-once；不做 XA/exactly-once，必须显式写出去重口径（主键 replace / 幂等键），并在验收中覆盖\"重复数据\"场景。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D10",
      "source_line": 37,
      "source_text": "D10 | 内置调度 | 引入 db-scheduler | 首版自带持久化调度，不依赖既有调度平台（见第 4 节事实与限制）",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d10-built-in-db-scheduler",
          "statement": "引入 db-scheduler 作为内置调度；首版自带持久化调度，不依赖既有调度平台。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D11",
      "source_line": 38,
      "source_text": "D11 | 实时 CDC | 进首版 | 首版必须交付实时 CDC（MySQL/PostgreSQL/Oracle 至少各一条链路）",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d11-realtime-cdc-in-first-release",
          "statement": "实时 CDC 进首版：MySQL/PostgreSQL/Oracle 至少各一条链路。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D12",
      "source_line": 39,
      "source_text": "D12 | 目标端范围 | 关系库互同步 + 文件/对象存储/湖仓 | 首版目标端不限于关系库，含文件、对象存储与湖仓表",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d12-target-scope-includes-files-and-lakehouse",
          "statement": "首版目标端不限于关系库，含文件、对象存储与湖仓表。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D13",
      "source_line": 40,
      "source_text": "D13 | 分库分表归并、准实时 Base+Log、SaaS/API 采集 | 全部进首版 | 六类场景全部纳入首版；不按窄 MVP 收敛",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d13-six-scenario-families-all-in-first-release",
          "statement": "分库分表归并、准实时 Base+Log、SaaS/API 采集全部进首版；六类场景全部纳入首版，不按窄 MVP 收敛。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D14",
      "source_line": 41,
      "source_text": "D14 | 国产库（达梦/Kingbase/openGauss） | 非目标 | 首版不做；须在下版立项或范围变更时重新评估",
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": "decision.plan-d14-domestic-databases-out-of-scope",
          "statement": "国产库（达梦 / Kingbase / openGauss）为非目标，首版不做；须在下版立项或范围变更时重新评估。"
        }
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "semantic_review": "required"
    },
    {
      "source_ref": "docs/.scratch/data-integration-module/plan/inputs/plan-decisions-2026-10-01.md",
      "source_id": "D15",
      "source_line": 42,
      "source_text": "D15 | 成功标准口径 | 确认（SC-001~SC-005） | 已确认；范围扩张后新增的 SC-006~SC-012 为候选，Spec 起草时细化",
      "targets": [
